				<r3d:repositoryUrl>https://naturecounts.ca</r3d:repositoryUrl>
				<r3d:description language="eng">NatureCounts is an open data platform that collects and interprets biodiversity data, and makes those data available and accessible to inform research and conservation action.
NatureCounts provides tools and features to:
- Facilitate data collection by citizen science and research programs. 
- Integrate and streamline data from hundreds of projects into a single database. 
- Support the analysis of the data to generate knowledge of bird populations, power exploration, and support decision-making. 
- Share data freely with the conservation community to drive conservation action and engage people with the natural world. 
- Provides tools and knowledge that support sound decision-making for policy and regulatory processes.</r3d:description>
